{"id":2736,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>4月8日至9日，由中共山西省委教育工作委员会主办的山西省高校领域总体国家安全观宣讲比赛在山西大学举行，我院学子李佳玥作品《文脉护安，薪火相传》荣获二等奖。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-M7CWiUzUiLmT2UHzU8LRWVoRMfL4NgYoRC8U49inllDnzU0gihFp2hmCIa0MShkUSyZMkyDLz-ZM4n7UmnVMNn7L87sLmCZMNV2UlM7n7QFnRAfnlW2MmWFM7-4MzNJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CsMRlJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6745&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5BA84612874DB4E6DD3A72686AFACDDF/D8AEBF62/4B359\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-LlnW7Ml-DM8l4LH7QRo7CanmvbnzLgPnNr2Ml7ZLRNbL7l0gihFp2hmCIa0M1ysU1y4oSy4n7rfLzM2MNUinmfkM7WVUlWkM8VfMR7ZUmrFM49ZLRWVMNMFUz9bozARgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDM4UigtA8pULcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6745&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次比赛以“统筹发展和安全 护航‘十五五’新征程”为主题，来自全省43所高校的优秀学生代表，围绕总体国家安全观相关内容进行宣讲。李佳玥立足青年视角，结合文化遗产传承、文化认同坚守与文化安全防护实践，以“文脉护安”小切口讲述国家安全大主题，生动展现新时代青年守护文化安全、传承中华文脉的使命担当。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-MzlWbolUYL4lsnHzA7nzLanmL4LmWgkLR6VMz6VLNV7LR-0gihFp2hmCIa0nShfLYybMkh7UNWRL4U8nmGsMmVRoRL4nzNDM4U4MmQ7M46FMRlbnNWVMzMFozvbLYb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CsMRlJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6745&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/EA394DBBC344F0761C833E9674366D77/459FBE53/9793\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 375px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-MzlWbolUYL4lsnHzA7nzLanmL4LmWgkLR6VMz6VLNV7LR-0gihFp2hmCIa0nShfLYybMkh7UNWRL4U8nmGsMmVRoRL4nzNDM4U4MmQ7M46FMRlbnNWVMzMFozvbLYb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CsMRlJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6745&e=.jpeg\"></p><p><br></p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-M7CWiUzUiLmT2UHzU8LRWVoRMfL4NgYoRC8U49inllDnzU0gihFp2hmCIa0MShkUSyZMkyDLz-ZM4n7UmnVMNn7L87sLmCZMNV2UlM7n7QFnRAfnlW2MmWFM7-4MzNJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CsMRlJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6745&e=.jpg"}